### Firstly login as ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.token);
    client.log("✓ Admin logged in, token: " + response.body.token.substring(0, 30) + "...");
%}

### target endpoint

GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/all
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}